{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/816575-white-wolf-publishing-wtf","id":816575,"title":"White Wolf Publishing WTF?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-25T19:03:23-08:00","id":816575,"title":"White Wolf Publishing WTF?","content":"I saw this in one monday meeting notes.<br /> A search turned up this.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.whitewolf-publishing.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.whitewolf-publishing.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.whitewolf-publishing.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.whitewolf-publishing.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> A later post mentioned some company called paardox buying the World Darkness IP.<br /> <br /> So how about a briefing here?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you want By Night Studios to release new LARP RULES for NWoD,<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/313137-open-letter-to-by-night-studios\" target=\"_blank\">like this post</a>.<br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=62\" data-tempid=\"temp_62_1418088885567_853\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","name":"Chattnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"879"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T19:19:34-08:00","id":816588,"title":"","content":"In October, a Swedish company called Paradox, which produces video games like the <i>Crusader Kings</i> franchise, bought the Classic World of Darkness, Chronicles of Darkness, and Exalted from CCP. They immediately spun those off into a new company called White Wolf Publishing.<br /> <br /> The new White Wolf intends to continue licensing these games for tabletop (to us at Onyx Path) and LARP (to By Night Studios), and to pursue other avenues such as video games. They'll be producing a fourth edition of <i>Vampire: The Masquerade</i> in-house.<br /> <br /> White Wolf's Lead Storyteller is Martin Ericsson, an old friend of mine from when we were at CCP. He modeled for Dracula in V20, and was a content designer. Outside of CCP, he ran pretty much the most excellent <i>Battlestar Galactica</i> LARP I've ever heard of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 01-25-2016, 10:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T19:20:04-08:00","id":816590,"title":"","content":"<b>2006:</b> White Wolf Publishing merges with CCP, makers of EVE Online. CCP owns all the White Wolf properties.<br /> <br /> <b>2011:</b> Onyx Path Publishing is founded. Onyx Path obtains licensing rights from CCP to publish tabletop products for the Classic and New Worlds of Darkness and Exalted, ownership of Scion, the Trinity Universe, and co-ownership of the Scarred Lands.<br /> <br /> <b>2015:</b> CCP sells the White Wolf properties to Paradox Interactive, makers of Crusader Kings, Europa Universalis and Hearts of Iron. Paradox now owns the Classic and New Worlds of Darkness and Exalted. The status of the licensing deal with Onyx Path is unclear for a few months as the two businesses negotiate, until a conclusion is publicly unveiled.<br /> <br /> <b>2016:</b> The current state of affairs. The New World of Darkness line has been renamed the Chronicles of Darkness, as Paradox wishes to push the Classic World of Darkness forward as a clear standing property. Onyx Path retains licensing rights to publish tabletop products for the Chronicles of Darkness and the World of Darkness 20th Anniversary Editions and (unless I'm mistaken) Exalted. Paradox, meanwhile, establishes a new White Wolf Publishing as a subsidiary, with stated goals to develop a new edition of Vampire: the Masquerade and possibly the other World of Darkness games. They show an interest in various media including tabletop books, LARP support, and video game tie-ins.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","user":"Stupid Loserman","date":". 01-25-2016, 10:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T19:26:26-08:00","id":816593,"title":"","content":"There's a giant thread detailing the forum's volatile knee-jerk reaction and eventual acceptance of the whole deal <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/738000-paradox-interactive-the-crusader-kings-people-not-the-conan-mutant-chronicles-ones-buy-the-white-wolf-properties-merged-x10#post738000\">here</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T05:00:42-08:00","id":816783,"title":"","content":"Thanks.<br /> Well from outside it can alway look a little precarious.<br /> These days so many creatives decisions are not for creative reasons but for imperatives driven by bean counters i other companies.<br /> Good to see that things are amicable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you want By Night Studios to release new LARP RULES for NWoD,<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/313137-open-letter-to-by-night-studios\" target=\"_blank\">like this post</a>.<br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=62\" data-tempid=\"temp_62_1418088885567_853\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","name":"Chattnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"879"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T19:34:53-08:00","id":817339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/816575-white-wolf-publishing-wtf?p=816593#post816593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a giant thread detailing the forum's volatile knee-jerk reaction and eventual acceptance of the whole deal <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/738000-paradox-interactive-the-crusader-kings-people-not-the-conan-mutant-chronicles-ones-buy-the-white-wolf-properties-merged-x10#post738000\">here</a></div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bHonestly the great butt clench of 2015 needs to be buried and forgotten. Right from the start it was fairly clear that nothing horrible was happening to our beloved game lines and the massive Chicken Little rumor mongering was more than a little disturbing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3065-nist498","name":"Nist498","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3065_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T19:56:08-08:00","id":817351,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nist498</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/816575-white-wolf-publishing-wtf?p=817339#post817339\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bHonestly the great butt clench of 2015 needs to be buried and forgotten. Right from the start it was fairly clear that nothing horrible was happening to our beloved game lines and the massive Chicken Little rumor mongering was more than a little disturbing.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know, hindsight is 20/20, but for the information we had at the time it was not unreasonable to be worried for the future of nWoD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T03:53:29-08:00","id":817504,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/816575-white-wolf-publishing-wtf?p=817351#post817351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know, hindsight is 20/20, but for the information we had at the time it was not unreasonable to be worried for the future of nWoD.</div> </div> </div> </div>A las the gulf between reasonable worries and unreasonable fear is just wide enough for crossing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T06:34:19-08:00","id":817557,"title":"","content":"Could we please avoid sitting in judgment over how the forums handled the announcement?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T08:47:08-08:00","id":817649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/816575-white-wolf-publishing-wtf?p=817557#post817557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could we please avoid sitting in judgment over how the forums handled the announcement?</div> </div> </div> </div>*shrugs* Understanding that you take the bad with the good with ANY fanbase is simply a reality of human beings. Not a judgement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T09:37:26-08:00","id":817693,"title":"","content":"I have to imagine if conversation was shut down there would be an even larger thread complaining about that and people would worry even more.<br /> <br /> As it was there were at least people suggesting everyone calm down, not blow everything out of proportion and wait for some real answers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 01-27-2016, 12:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T12:16:25-08:00","id":817819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/816575-white-wolf-publishing-wtf?p=81